# Third-party reference materials (large, external, nested git repos, binaries)
# Re-obtainable from upstream sources; not version-controlled here.
# ANCHORED to the repo root: the unanchored "reference/" also swallowed ns-3's
# own src/*/reference source dirs (wifi error-rate-tables.h etc.) - rescued
# 2026-08-25 after a GitHub-zip build broke (§12.54 lesson).
/reference/

# Build artifacts (within ns-3-alibabacloud build tree)
# NOTE: "build-*/" was removed - it never matched the actual build dir (named
# "build", covered by the rule above) and only swallowed ns-3's
# simulation/build-support/ (CMake macros the configure step needs).
build/
*.o
*.obj
*.so
*.a
*.dylib

# ns-3 build lock files
.lock-ns3_*
*.lock-ns3*

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
*.swo
